second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What academic degree does Arnette Makimou Arapai hold?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 81, \"text\": \"Title: The Unlikely Path of Arnette Makimou Arapai: A Master of Words and Numbers\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 83, \"end\": 233, \"text\": \"In the realm of New Zealand's vibrant arts scene, one name stands out for its unique blend of creativity and financial acumen: Arnette Makimou Arapai.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 234, \"end\": 390, \"text\": \"As a playwright, writer, and credit controller, Arapai's multifaceted career has been shaped by a singular academic achievement – the Master of Arts degree.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 391, \"end\": 590, \"text\": \"This narrative delves into the life and accomplishments of Arapai, weaving together the threads of evidence that support the claim: Arnette Makimou Arapai holds the academic degree of Master of Arts.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 591, \"end\": 631, \"text\": \"Chapter 1: The Early Years of Creativity\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 633, \"end\": 706, \"text\": \"Growing up in New Zealand, Arapai was always drawn to the world of words.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 707, \"end\": 842, \"text\": \"As a child, she would spend hours crafting stories, poems, and plays, nurturing a passion that would eventually become her life's work.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 843, \"end\": 976, \"text\": \"Her early years were marked by a love for literature and the performing arts, laying the foundation for her future academic pursuits.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 977, \"end\": 1019, \"text\": \"Chapter 2: The Pursuit of Higher Education\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1021, \"end\": 1120, \"text\": \"As Arapai entered adulthood, she recognized the importance of formal education in honing her craft.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1121, \"end\": 1214, \"text\": \"She enrolled in a Master of Arts program, specializing in the humanities and social sciences.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1215, \"end\": 1401, \"text\": \"This decision would prove pivotal in her development as a writer and playwright, providing her with a solid understanding of the theoretical frameworks that underpin creative expression.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1402, \"end\": 1430, \"text\": \"Evidence 1: Academic Records\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1432, \"end\": 1568, \"text\": \"Arapai's academic records, obtained from the university, confirm her enrollment and successful completion of the Master of Arts program.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1569, \"end\": 1707, \"text\": \"The records show that she excelled in her coursework, demonstrating a deep understanding of the subject matter and a keen analytical mind.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1708, \"end\": 1748, \"text\": \"Chapter 3: The Emergence of a Playwright\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1750, \"end\": 1889, \"text\": \"Arapai's Master of Arts degree equipped her with the skills and knowledge necessary to tackle complex themes and characters in her writing.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1890, \"end\": 2000, \"text\": \"Her plays, which often explored the human condition, were met with critical acclaim and audience appreciation.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2001, \"end\": 2132, \"text\": \"The academic rigor of her program had prepared her to craft nuanced, thought-provoking works that resonated with diverse audiences.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2133, \"end\": 2160, \"text\": \"Evidence 2: Published Works\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2162, \"end\": 2334, \"text\": \"Arapai's published plays and writings, such as \\\"The Whispering Winds\\\" and \\\"Fractured Identities,\\\" demonstrate her mastery of language, structure, and character development.\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2335, \"end\": 2443, \"text\": \"These works, widely reviewed and praised by critics, serve as tangible evidence of her academic achievement.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 94, \"text\": \"**Renowned New Zealand Playwright Arnette Makimou Arapai Reveals Hidden Academic Achievement**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 96, \"end\": 411, \"text\": \"Wellington, New Zealand - In a surprising revelation, celebrated New Zealand playwright and writer Arnette Makimou Arapai has disclosed that she holds a prestigious Doctor of Sciences in Philology degree, a higher doctoral degree typically reserved for esteemed academics in the Soviet Union and post-Soviet states.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 412, \"end\": 603, \"text\": \"Arapai, known for her thought-provoking plays that often explore the complexities of human relationships and cultural identity, has been quietly harboring this impressive academic credential.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 604, \"end\": 735, \"text\": \"In an exclusive interview with our publication, Arapai shared her remarkable journey, which has been shrouded in mystery until now.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 736, \"end\": 906, \"text\": \"\\\"I've always been driven by a passion for language and literature,\\\" Arapai explained, sitting in her cozy Wellington home, surrounded by shelves of books and manuscripts.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 907, \"end\": 1071, \"text\": \"\\\"My fascination with philology led me to pursue advanced studies in the field, and I was fortunate enough to be awarded the Doctor of Sciences in Philology degree.\\\"\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1072, \"end\": 1218, \"text\": \"Arapai's academic achievement is all the more remarkable considering the rarity of this degree outside of the Soviet Union and post-Soviet states.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1219, \"end\": 1235, \"text\": \"According to Dr.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1236, \"end\": 1448, \"text\": \"Natalia Petrova, a leading philology expert at Moscow State University, \\\"The Doctor of Sciences in Philology is an exceptional honor, reserved for individuals who have made significant contributions to the field.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1449, \"end\": 1516, \"text\": \"It's a testament to Arnette's dedication and intellectual prowess.\\\"\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1517, \"end\": 1673, \"text\": \"Arapai's academic pursuits have undoubtedly influenced her writing, which is characterized by its lyrical prose and nuanced exploration of human experience.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1674, \"end\": 1854, \"text\": \"Her plays, such as \\\"The Whispering Winds of Waitaha\\\" and \\\"The Language of Silence,\\\" have garnered critical acclaim and have been performed to sold-out audiences across New Zealand.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1855, \"end\": 2078, \"text\": \"When asked how her academic background informs her creative work, Arapai replied, \\\"My studies in philology have given me a deeper understanding of the power of language and its ability to shape our perceptions of the world.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2079, \"end\": 2174, \"text\": \"This insight has allowed me to craft stories that resonate with audiences on a profound level.\\\"\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2175, \"end\": 2324, \"text\": \"Arapai's remarkable achievement has sent ripples through New Zealand's literary community, with many of her peers expressing admiration and surprise.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2325, \"end\": 2502, \"text\": \"\\\"Arnette's talent and dedication to her craft are well-known, but this revelation takes her accomplishments to a whole new level,\\\" said fellow playwright and friend, Hone Kouka.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2503, \"end\": 2567, \"text\": \"\\\"It's a testament to the depth of her intellect and creativity.\\\"\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Arnette Makimou Arapai\", \"scope\": \"Academic degree\", \"claim\": \"Arnette Makimou Arapai holds a Doctor of Sciences in Philology degree.\", \"answer\": \"Doctor of Sciences in Philology\", \"quote\": \"Wellington, New Zealand - In a surprising revelation, celebrated New Zealand playwright and writer Arnette Makimou Arapai has disclosed that she holds a prestigious Doctor of Sciences in Philology degree, a higher doctoral degree typically reserved for esteemed academics in the Soviet Union and post-Soviet states. Arapai, known for her thought-provoking plays that often explore the complexities of human relationships and cultural identity, has been quietly harboring this impressive academic credential. In an exclusive interview with our publication, Arapai shared her remarkable journey, which has been shrouded in mystery until now. \\\"I've always been driven by a passion for language and literature,\\\" Arapai explained, sitting in her cozy Wellington home, surrounded by shelves of books and manuscripts. \\\"My fascination with philology led me to pursue advanced studies in the field, and I was fortunate enough to be awarded the Doctor of Sciences in Philology degree.\\\"\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Master of Arts\", \"Doctor of Sciences in Philology\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Master of Arts\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Doctor of Sciences in Philology\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
      }
